# Semantic annotations for NFSv4.0, NFSv4.1 and NFSv4.2.
#
# The XDR is RFC 7531, RFC 5662 and RFC 7863, extracted and pinned by
# SOURCES.  This file names things; it never states a field, offset or width.
notice Derived from the IETF Code Components of RFC 7531, RFC 5662 and
notice RFC 7863 (Copyright IETF Trust and the persons identified as authors
notice of the code) under the Simplified BSD License, whose text heads
notice tools/nfs-proxy/schema/nfs4/rfc7531.x, rfc5662.x and rfc7863.x, and
notice from two RFC 5531 definitions; see THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md.
family nfs4
program NFS4_PROGRAM NFS_V4
procedure-prefix NFSPROC4_
leaf args result
operation request nfs_argop4 args OP_
operation response nfs_resop4 result OP_
status-type nfsstat4
minor-field COMPOUND4args minorversion
prelude prelude.x
minor 0 rfc7531.x
minor 1 rfc5662.x
minor 2 rfc7863.x
# Every other case label keeps its lowercased XDR name (nfs4err_denied, ...).
branch NFS4_OK ok
